# Audio Capture via PowerShell | T1123 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_powershell_audio_capture.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (CommandLine IN ("*WindowsAudioDevice-Powershell-Cmdlet*", "*Toggle-AudioDevice*", "*Get-AudioDevice *", "*Set-AudioDevice *", "*Write-AudioDevice *"))
